QUERY NAME: qryMilestonesImport_Update
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
PARAMETERS [Forms]![frmMilestone_Import]![pickProject] Text ( 255 );
SELECT tblMilestone.Project, tblMilestone.Number, tblMilestone.Description, tblMilestone.DateDue, tempMilestone.Description AS NewDescription, tempMilestone.DateDue AS NewDateDue
FROM tempMilestone INNER JOIN tblMilestone ON tempMilestone.Number = tblMilestone.Number
WHERE (((tblMilestone.Project)=[Forms]![frmMilestone_Import]![pickProject]));

